 "amendments": {
  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of the city of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S6355",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6355-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S6355\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to amend the local finance law, in relation\nto bonds and notes of the city of Yonkers\n\n PURPOSE : Extender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation\non serial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2016 to June 30, 2017.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\n\nSection one of the bill amends Section 54.40 of the local finance law\nas amended by chapter 21 of the laws of 2015 to extend the city's\nauthorization to issue bonds and notes through negotiated sale to June\n30, 2017\n\n JUSTIFICATION : Extender law - this bill extends the marketing\nlimitation on serial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2016 to June\n30, 2017, The authorization for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales\nof its bonds or notes is vital to improving the city's financial\nstability and independence. The city's bonding authority will expire\non June 30, 2016 unless it is extended for one year. The continuation\nof this power will allow more cost-effective financing for the city of\nYonkers.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY : 2015 - S3463 Chapter 21; 2014 - S6313 Chapter\n70; 2013 S3020 Chapter 69; 2012 - S6460 Chapter 72; 2011 - S2982\nChapter 66; 2010 S6720 Chapter 125; 2009 - S3336 Chapter 77; 2008 -\nS6878 Chapter 144\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS : None to the State.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE : This act shall take effect immediately\n",
